{"thread":{"threadID":2903,"boardID":121,"topic":"Admin Besprechung 06.09.15","time":1440846761,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","lastPostTime":1441550365,"lastPoster":"Zeschter","replies":15,"views":158,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":36055,"threadID":2903,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"Admin Besprechung 06.09.15","time":1440846761,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><s>Am 5 September 2015 (in einer Woche) wird es eine Admin-Besprechung geben.</s><br>Soweit möglich, sollen bitte alle Teammitglieder am Samstag um 20:00 auf unserem Teamspeak³ Server aufzufinden sein.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Themen werden unteranderem folgende sein:<br>- Die letzte Zeit bei Dream<br>- Wie geht es weiter<br>- Administratoren<br>- Allgemeine Themen</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ihr könnt jedes Thema was mit der Community zutun hat ansprechen.<br>Falls euch etwas stört, Ihr etwas verbessern wollt oder anderes.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Versucht bitte anwesend zu sein</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sky</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong><u>Neues Datum: Sonntag 06.09.2015 20:00 Uhr</u></strong></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36056,"threadID":2903,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1440846903,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kann nichts versprechen aber Ich werds versuchen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36069,"threadID":2903,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1440848844,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bin leider auf Kreta</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36071,"threadID":2903,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1440849917,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Habs mir im Kalender notiert, sollte zu der Zeit eigentlich, falls nichts dazwischen kommt, anwesend sein.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36072,"threadID":2903,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1440850798,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>werde da sein</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36084,"threadID":2903,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1440866460,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kann ebenfalls nichts versprechen, werde aber mein bestes geben.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36101,"threadID":2903,"userID":1101,"username":"Citrien","subject":"","time":1440888049,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Samstag 20:00...<br>Warum machst du ne Besprechung zur Zeit, wo jeder Party machen könnte? XD</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36130,"threadID":2903,"userID":1902,"username":"Sutitchi","subject":"","time":1440958389,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Stimme Citrien zu. Ein Sonntag und vllt ein wenig früher von der Zeit wäre passender.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Na mal sehen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36501,"threadID":2903,"userID":1599,"username":"Abendstille","subject":"","time":1441456499,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich weiss noch nicht ob ich sicher kann,muss noch Familie besuchen usw und bekomme besuch weil ich ja letztens vom urlaub kam und alle so tun als wäre ich aus syrien gekommen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36504,"threadID":2